Below is one complete example of a Flask application that meets the requirements. In this example the API accepts JSON POST requests and validates inputs (ensuring that the data samples are lists of numbers). Statistical tests are implemented using NumPy and SciPy. (Note that in a production service you might wish to refactor repeated code, improve logging and security, and add tests.) 

Save this file (for example as app.py), install Flask, NumPy, and SciPy (for example using pip install flask numpy scipy), and then run it.

